    "title": "Cameras, sensors, and 3D body scans: All the tech helping eliminate blown calls",
    "source": "Ars Technica",
    "url": "https://arstechnica.com/gadgets/2026/06/cameras-sensors-and-3d-body-scans-all-the-tech-helping-eliminate-blown-calls/",
    "published": "2026-06-12",
    "summary": "This World Cup, refs will use digital twins of each player to view plays from every angle.",
    "full_text": "At the 2026 World Cup, the refs on the field and the officials on the sidelines will be able to use an abundance of tech to help call penalties, spot offside violations, and make other consequential decisions.\nThe video assistant referee system, known as VAR, and the semi-automated offside technology (SAOT) have been used in soccer for years. But the setup at this summer's World Cup represents some of the most advanced uses of adjudication tech to date—not just in soccer, but across all high-level sports.\nDuring each match, the pitch will be awash in sensors, cameras, and new computer vision software. One especially notable advancement this year is the use of digital twins. Every player in the World Cup has had their body scanned by a computer. The digital twin of any athlete—which precisely matches their height, limb length, and shoe size—can be dropped into a virtual simulation of the game to determine their exact position relative to the ball, boundary lines, and other players. Officials can use all of this data to help spot infractions, determine penalties, and smooth out the edges of the beautiful game.Read full article\nComments",
    "lang": "en",
    "title_cn": "摄像头、传感器和 3D 人体扫描：所有有助于消除通话失败的技术",
    "summary_cn": "本届世界杯，裁判将使用每位球员的数字孪生从各个角度观看比赛。",
    "full_text_cn": "在 2026 年世界杯上，场上的裁判和场边的官员将能够使用大量的技术来帮助判罚、发现越位违规行为并做出其他重要决定。\n视频助理裁判系统（即 VAR）和半自动越位技术（SAOT）已在足球领域使用多年。但今年夏天世界杯的设置代表了迄今为止裁判技术的一些最先进的应用——不仅在足球领域，而且在所有高水平运动中。\n每场比赛期间，球场上都会布满传感器、摄像机和新的计算机视觉软件。今年一项特别值得注意的进步是数字孪生的使用。世界杯上每位球员的身体都经过了计算机扫描。任何运动员的数字双胞胎（精确匹配他们的身高、肢体长度和鞋子尺寸）都可以放入游戏的虚拟模拟中，以确定他们相对于球、边界线和其他球员的准确位置。官员可以使用所有这些数据来帮助发现违规行为、确定处罚并消除这场精彩比赛的边缘。阅读全文\n评论",
